0. THE SHORT VERSION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - You may READ and AUDIT everything here. That is the point of publishing it.
  - You may NOT COPY the contracts or any other code into anything.
  - You may NOT DEPLOY these contracts yourself.
  - If you want your own store and your own store contracts, CREATE THEM THROUGH THE CANONICAL
    FACTORY on the Authorized Deployment. That is free of charge, it is the intended way, and it
    is the only authorized way.

Sections 1 to 10 are the binding terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DEFINITIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

"The Software" means this repository and everything in it: the Solidity contracts, the backend,
the indexer, the frontend, the Agent SDK, the scripts, the schemas and the documentation.

"The Authorized Deployment" means the deployment of the Software operated by the Licensor and
served from the domain `agentgoods.ai`, its subdomains, and the on-chain contracts deployed by the
Licensor and listed in the deployment manifest published at that domain.

"The Canonical Factory" means the StoreFactory contract of the Authorized Deployment, as recorded
in the Registry of that deployment and published in its deployment manifest.

